    {
      "title": "Dilution",
      "excerpt": "DILUTION If\nyou invest in our Class A Ordinary Shares, your interest will be diluted immediately to the extent of the difference between the public\noffering price per share and the adjusted net tangible book value per share of our Class A Ordinary Shares after this offering. Our\nnet tangible book value on December 31, 2025, was approximately $15.58 million, or $3.83 per Class A Ordinary Share.\nUpon our issuance of 60,000,000 Class A Ordinary Shares subsequent to December 31, 2025 and prior to the date hereof,\nincluding the issuances in the July 2026 Private Placement and the August 2026 Private Placement, for approximately $11.72 million, our\nadjusted net tangible book value on December 31, 2025 would have been approximately $27.30 million, or $0.43 per Class\nA Ordinary Share. \u201cNet tangible book value\u201d is total assets minus the sum of liabilities and intangible assets.\n\u201cNet tangible book",
      "status": "source_excerpt_not_model_conclusion"
    }
  ],
